==Trivia==
*In The Battle Cats Unite!, this is the only banner to be outright removed in an [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.7 Update#August 15, 2023 Update Patch|update]]. It was replaced with [[SUPERFEST (Gacha Event)|SUPERFEST]].
**Japanese Version replaced it on August 15, 2023 with the introduction of Shadow Gao.
**The International Version replaced it on December 15, 2025 as to celebrate the game receiving 1.6 million copies sold.

